sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as C++ Application
    participant Device as /dev/sysmon
    participant Driver as Linux Driver
    participant Kernel as Linux Kernel

    User->>App: Select kernel statistics
    App->>Device: ioctl(GET_STATS)
    Device->>Driver: ioctl request
    Driver->>Kernel: Collect statistics
    Kernel-->>Driver: Statistics
    Driver-->>App: copy_to_user()
    App-->>User: Display statistics
